#
# The guest's Vulkan (gpu/gvk/gvk.c), for tools/hookgen's route list. A game that links NVIDIA's Vulkan driver calls
# the entry points of its loader, which the module of the driver exports. With the guest_vulkan setting, gvk.c puts
# its own function into the slot of each of them, and they call the host's Vulkan. The direct calls of the game to these
# functions go through their slots only when the recompiler routes them, so each one has a route line here. The list
# is the loader's 246 exports in one driver: Vulkan 1.0 to 1.3, and the surface, swapchain and display extensions.
# gvk_api.c implements the 1.0 and 1.1 functions a game needs, and tells the game it has Vulkan 1.1
family gvk
